//BKCOMPL  JOB (ACCTINFO),'BANKCORE COMPILE',
//             CLASS=A,MSGCLASS=X,MSGLEVEL=(1,1),NOTIFY=&SYSUID
//*********************************************************************
//* JOB       : BKCOMPL
//* PURPOSE   : COMPILE AND LINK-EDIT ONE BANKCORE MODULE.
//*             CHANGE MEMBER BELOW AND SUBMIT.
//*-------------------------------------------------------------------
//* PLACEHOLDERS - REPLACE WITH INSTALLATION VALUES BEFORE SUBMITTING:
//*   JOB CARD   ACCOUNTING INFO, CLASS, MSGCLASS (SITE STANDARDS)
//*   JCLLIB     LIBRARY HOLDING PROCEDURE BKCBLCL
//*   APPHLQ     APPLICATION HIGH LEVEL QUALIFIER
//*   IGYHLQ     COMPILER LIBRARY HLQ (ASK THE SYSTEMS PROGRAMMER)
//*   LEHLQ      LANGUAGE ENVIRONMENT HLQ ('CEE' IS THE IBM DEFAULT,
//*              THE INSTALLATION MAY HAVE CHANGED IT)
//*-------------------------------------------------------------------
//* PREREQUISITE DATASETS (PDSE):
//*   &APPHLQ..BANKCORE.COBOL    SOURCE     RECFM=FB LRECL=80
//*   &APPHLQ..BANKCORE.COPYLIB  COPYBOOKS  RECFM=FB LRECL=80
//*   &APPHLQ..BANKCORE.LOADLIB  LOAD LIB   RECFM=U
//*   GIT FOLDERS ARE FLATTENED: EVERY .CBL -> COBOL(MEMBER),
//*   EVERY .CPY -> COPYLIB(MEMBER).
//*-------------------------------------------------------------------
//* NOT PORTABLE TO Z/OS (LAB-ONLY SOURCE, DO NOT COMPILE HERE):
//*   ACCTDAO, CUSTDAO, TRXDAO  -> REPLACED BY DB2 VERSIONS (PHASE 2)
//*********************************************************************
//         JCLLIB ORDER=YOURHLQ.BANKCORE.PROCLIB
//         SET APPHLQ=YOURHLQ
//         SET IGYHLQ=IGY.CHANGEME
//         SET LEHLQ=CEE
//*
//BUILD    EXEC BKCBLCL,MEMBER=ACCTINQ
